  "content": "\n\n<p>本整合包已正式發布！<br><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Caveopolis/BH_NU_HEADER.png\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fbbl\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e6c201ec-eab5-4966-ac31-fd785a6b88e0.webp\" width=\"1122\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Caveopolis/BH_NU_BANNER1.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Caveopolis/BH_NU_BANNER2.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Caveopolis/BH_NU_BANNER3.png\"></p>\n<p>Caveopolis 是一款以任務為導向的 Minecraft 1.18.2 整合包。深入地底世界，沿途打造全新的方塊與機器。收錄了 Thermal、Mekanism 以及自訂機械等模組。你能深入地底多深？<br><br>探索世界各層級以取得新素材並解鎖各式模組</p>\n<p>加入 Discord 回報錯誤、問題或提出建議</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/UpJknJ8\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/UpJknJ8</a></p>\n<p>點擊下方圖片即可擁有自己的伺服器。使用優惠碼：<strong>&nbsp;skyopolis</strong>&nbsp;可享&nbsp;<strong>25% 折扣</strong>。4GB 方案非常適合此整合包：</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://bisecthosting.com/skyopolis\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/323/702/310/172/hosing.png\"></a></p>",
